urce category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1139341A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJITSU LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI MASAKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITSU LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI, MASAKAZU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI MASAKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI, MASAKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An information reproducing device on which a plurality of transcription units are formed with a region by which the units can be magnetically insulated from each other therebetween is placed so as to face an information recording medium. A plurality of the recording marks of an information recording medium are transcripted onto the information reproducing device so as to be insulated from each other. A light beam is applied to the information reproducing device to reproduce the recording  marks recorded with a high density by magneto-optical reproduction or maximum likelihood reproduction.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un dispositif de reproduction d'informations sur lequel une pluralité d'unités de transcription sont formées avec une région au moyen de laquelle les unités peuvent être isolées magnétiquement les unes des autres. Ce dispositif est placé de manière à être opposé à un support d'enregistrement d'informations. Une pluralité de marques d'enregistrement d'un support d'enregistrement d'informations sont transcrites sur le dispositif d'enregistrement d'informations de façon à être isolées les unes des autres. Un faisceau lumineux est appliqué sur le dispositif d'enregistrement d'informations pour reproduire les marques d'enregistrement enregistrées, à haute densité, par reproduction magnéto-optique ou reproduction à maximum de vraisemblance.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>